{"id": "79", "type": "archive", "slug": "national-lecture-tours", "path": "event-category/national-lecture-tours", "title": "National Lecture Tours Archives", "seoTitleAbsolute": null, "seoTitle": "National Lecture Tours Archives", "seoDesc": null, "canonical": "/event-category/national-lecture-tours/", "ogTitle": "National Lecture Tours Archives - Hippocrates Wellness", "ogDesc": null, "terms": {}, "content_live": "<div id=\"content\" class=\"site-main\">\n<div class=\"page-header\">\n<h1 class=\"entry-title\">Event Category: <span>National Lecture Tours</span></h1>\t\t</div>\n<div class=\"page-content\">\n<article class=\"post\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/pioneers-of-longevity/\">Pioneers of Longevity Tour</a></h2><a href=\"/pioneers-of-longevity/\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" width=\"800\" height=\"571\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01-Orleans-MA-2-1024x731.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01-Orleans-MA-2-1024x731.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01-Orleans-MA-2-300x214.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01-Orleans-MA-2-768x549.png 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/01-Orleans-MA-2.png 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a><p>&nbsp; Come listen and learn from Hippocrates Wellness world-leading experts for a life transforming experience! Local Host: Dolores Alberti Suggested Donation: $15.00 to reserve your Living Lifestyle Experience featuring Brian and Anna Maria Clement. &nbsp;</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"post\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/pioneers-of-longevity-tour-easton/\">Pioneers of Longevity Tour</a></h2><a href=\"/pioneers-of-longevity-tour-easton/\"><img width=\"800\" height=\"571\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02-Easton-MA-1-1024x731.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02-Easton-MA-1-1024x731.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02-Easton-MA-1-300x214.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02-Easton-MA-1-768x549.png 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/02-Easton-MA-1.png 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a><p>Awaken Your Senses to 70 Years of Celebration in Optimum Health with World Leading Pioneers of Longevity Local Host: Nancy Antonucci Suggested Donation: $15.00 to reserve your Living Lifestyle Experience featuring Brian and Anna Maria Clement.</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"post\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/brian-clement-farm-tour-tasting-grand-event/\">Brian Clement Farm Tour and Tasting Grand Event</a></h2><a href=\"/brian-clement-farm-tour-tasting-grand-event/\"><img width=\"800\" height=\"571\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1-1024x731.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1-1024x731.png 1024w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1-300x214.png 300w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1-768x549.png 768w, /wp-content/uploads/2026/08/04-Goshen-NY-1.png 1400w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" /></a><p>“Awaken Your Senses” to 70 Years of Celebration in Optimum Health with World Leading Pioneers of Longevity. Hippocrates Wellness: Celebrating 70 years of guiding global clients to optimum health and peak achievement through personalized wellness solutions. Perfect Foods is announcing a new in-person farm tour at our indoor farm in Goshen, NY. After 40+ years of growing [&hellip;]</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"post\">\n<h2 class=\"entry-title\"><a href=\"/awaken-your-senses/\">Awaken Your Senses: 70 Years of Longevity with Dr. Brian and Anna Clement</a></h2><a href=\"/awaken-your-senses/\"><img width=\"800\" height=\"571\" src=\"/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/10-Hamilton-Township-NJ-1-1024x731.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-post-image\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"/wp-content/uploads/20